# Phase 2, part 1: the four tiers with the main combination (typing on,
# REPLICA IDENTITY FULL), Sluice 0.8.0 at 1 CPU, three repetitions each.
#
#   scripts/queue.sh plans/phase2-tiers.plan results/phase2/raw
#
# Tiers (count:members:streams:typists per room, a message every 15 s):
#   realistic   5:80:20:0.4                     100 streams,    27 changes/s,    32 events/s
#   high        14:80:25:0.3,1:200:50:1         400 streams,    89 changes/s,   126 events/s
#   very-high   50:80:25:0.3,5:200:50:1       1 500 streams,   337 changes/s,   503 events/s
#   unicorn     380:80:28:0.24,16:250:85:1   12 000 streams, 2 320 changes/s, 3 500 events/s
#
# A typist publishes every 2 s to the other streams of its room; a class of R
# rooms with K typists per room has floor(K·R) of them.
#
# The unicorn needs more than the production limits: SLUICE_MAX_STREAMS=15000,
# and 4 GB (GOMEMLIMIT about 3.6 GiB, twice the ~1.8 GiB peak extrapolated from
# 100-1 500 streams), so memory does not decide whether 1 CPU is enough. Its
# minimum memory comes from the memory ramps and the ceiling, not from these runs.

realistic-main-r3 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=5:80:20:0.4 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
high-main-r1 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=14:80:25:0.3,1:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
high-main-r2 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=14:80:25:0.3,1:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
high-main-r3 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=14:80:25:0.3,1:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
veryhigh-main-r1 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=50:80:25:0.3,5:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
veryhigh-main-r2 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=50:80:25:0.3,5:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
veryhigh-main-r3 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=50:80:25:0.3,5:200:50:1 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
unicorn-main-r1 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=380:80:28:0.24,16:250:85:1 LOAD_DURATION=60m LOAD_ARRIVAL=2m SLUICE_MAX_STREAMS=15000 SLUICE_MEM_LIMIT=4g

# Lost to the queue collision at 11:13 UTC (results/phase2/notes.md). r2 was re-run; r1 was not, when the
# baseline was cut down to what phase 3 needs: the realistic tier has two repetitions.
realistic-main-r1 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=5:80:20:0.4 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
realistic-main-r2 rooms -e env/pin-20cpu.env LOAD_ROOM_MIX=5:80:20:0.4 LOAD_DURATION=30m LOAD_ARRIVAL=30s
